<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets 13-week bill auction at 12.75pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets 13-week bill auction at 12.75pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Wednesday set an auction offering five billion crowns in 13-week central bank liquidity bills for Thursday.</p>
<p>Limit price on bids in the Dutch-style auction has been set at 968,775 crowns on each one million crown bill, implying a maximum gross yield of 12.75 percent.</p>
<p>Bids must be submitted to the CNB by 1200 local (1100 gmt).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
